From 1d506d2bd168496cf968e444dfbf47d11b740b0e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cycles Houdini stable rebase <stable-rebase@localhost>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:52:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Include owned resource revisions in image identity and
 numeric internal sockets in shader/displacement identity; isolate derived
 cache lookup by revision/configuration; propagate image-load failures to
 render progress. Unconfigured upstream resources retain the default cache
 lookup.

Locked-Patch: patches/0010-texture-resource-revisions.patch
Locked-Patch-SHA256: 3a19b25f869977726b33e0c01d2b8c5e972d891a16ffa56dc7d78e5ec5a3c313
Contract: docs/renderer-patch-contracts.md
Related-Fixture: tests/houdini_texture_cache_smoke.py
Qualification: Source replay only; no new runtime qualification asserted.

Rebased-From: 1afcc15aa9aebd2a7d803fbf45da2ea805ebbf0d
Previous-Patch: patches/0010-texture-resource-revisions.patch
Previous-Patch-SHA256: 3a19b25f869977726b33e0c01d2b8c5e972d891a16ffa56dc7d78e5ec5a3c313
Rationale: Owned resource revision tokens and cache identities let an embedding replace bytes without changing filenames; upstream callers do not yet publish that identity.
Contract: Include owned resource revisions in image identity and numeric internal sockets in shader/displacement identity; isolate derived cache lookup by revision/configuration; propagate image-load failures to render progress. Unconfigured upstream resources retain the default cache lookup.
Tests: tests/houdini_texture_cache_smoke.py, scripts/verify-upstream-patches.py

